  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Wow. So a lot happened. The Gray Man, huh... never met him myself, but the stories don't paint him as so cooperative. Wonder what his game is?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_033.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Forget the monster king; tell me of this monster cure. The Broken Branch, they turned a vampire mortal. They removed the Curse?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-OUT_008.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And threatened to break the branches of the World Tree. Meaning Bartleby. Meaning, what? Leylines? Because that can't be good.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_034.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Bartleby can burn for all I care. We've not felt his beneficence here. But this ability to remove the Curse, that could be real hope.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-OUT_009.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Bring me this Lucy creature. I would examine her myself.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-OUT_010.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Seems the Broken Branch took her. And the Gray Man says they're on the nearest Mortal Plain.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_035.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Then we shall travel there at once. Pack the wagons! Hitch the mounts! We ride! Scion, you just wait by the fire. You would only be in our way.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-OUT_011.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Mortal Plain is but a short trek through the Whispering Woods. You may use the same Demox as before to traverse them.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-OUT_013.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Beware that Plain. Tis a foul place of desperate, wretched creatures. We cannot glamour you here. You must face this den unprotected.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-OUT_014.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This is vampire territory, Wizard. And not the silly Demimortals you're used to. Trust nothing, least of all them. Be careful.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_036.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Vampires? Are you mad?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Mayor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Mayor_McCreary_DM-OUT_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687151,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
